Subject: You have 2 tips waiting on MergeTip

=== text ===
You have 2 tips waiting to be claimed. Nothing is charged until you claim.

- 5,000 sats from @maintainer for the review on acme/widgets#42 (https://github.com/acme/widgets/pull/42): new, claim by 2026-11-25
  Claim: https://mergetip.dev/claim/q2V3

- 21 sats from @octo on acme/gadgets#7 (https://github.com/acme/gadgets/issues/7): expires on 2026-11-02
  Claim: https://mergetip.dev/claim/q2V3

- 5,000 sats from @maintainer on acme/widgets#42 (https://github.com/acme/widgets/pull/42): expired unclaimed; nothing was charged


--
You get this because someone tipped you on GitHub with MergeTip. MergeTip never holds your money: tips go straight from the sender's wallet to yours.
Unsubscribe (you'll still get GitHub mentions): https://api.mergetip.dev/v1/email/unsubscribe?token=u.abc
